one:  a
two:  ab
three:abc
integer:  an integer, 3
real:     a real, 3.5
fraction: a fraction, 1|2
widened: read as a real, 4
exact:   read as a real, 4
letter:  one character, q
word:    a string of 5
as a dog:    something a dog eats
as an animal:something an animal eats
present: a number, 7
absent:  maybe a number, no
parent's: the parent's, given 1
child's:  the child's, given x
